sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Frontend
    participant Filter as JWT Filter
    participant Val as Validation Engine
    participant Cache as Caffeine Cache
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    
    UI->>Filter: POST /api/v1/records (JWT: tenant=acme)
    Filter->>Filter: Extract 'acme' -> ThreadLocal
    Filter->>Val: Pass Payload
    
    Val->>Cache: Get Metadata for 'acme'
    alt Cache Miss
        Cache->>DB: SELECT * FROM acme.attribute_definition
        DB-->>Cache: Return Rules
    end
    Cache-->>Val: Rules (nhom_mau: required, string)
    
    Val->>Val: Validate JSON Payload
    alt Invalid
        Val-->>UI: 400 Bad Request
    else Valid
        Val->>DB: Hibernate GET Connection
        DB->>DB: SET SCHEMA 'acme'
        Val->>DB: INSERT INTO customers (custom_properties)
        DB-->>UI: 200 OK
    end\n